<Layout title="Research" description="My research in convex optimisation and semidefinite programming.">
  <header class="page-header"><p class="eyebrow">Research</p><h1>Research</h1><p>My research concerns scalable methods for semidefinite programming, structured matrix optimisation, and self-concordant barriers.</p></header>
  <section><h2>Current directions</h2><ul><li><strong>Structured semidefinite optimisation</strong>. Exploiting matrix structure in large positive semidefinite constraints.</li><li><strong>Self-concordant barriers</strong>. Proving and analysing self-concordance of low barrier parameter barriers for structured cones.</li><li><strong>Numerical methods</strong>. Developing custom numerical solvers geared towards large-scale, practical problems.</li></ul></section>
</Layout>
<style>.page-header{margin-bottom:3rem}.eyebrow{color:var(--accent);font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase}.page-header p:last-child,li{color:var(--text-muted)}li{margin:1rem 0}li strong{color:var(--text)}</style>
